1
00:03:23,478 --> 00:03:29,478
A threat to Superman is a threat to society.

2
00:06:46,956 --> 00:06:52,956
Injustice is a animation, science fiction, fantasy film directed by Matt Peters.

3
00:10:10,434 --> 00:10:16,434
When Lois Lane is killed, an unhinged Superman
decides to take control of the Earth.

4
00:13:33,913 --> 00:13:39,913
Determined to stop him, Batman creates a team of freedom-fighting heroes.

5
00:16:57,391 --> 00:17:03,391
But when superheroes go to war, can the world survive?

6
00:20:20,869 --> 00:20:26,869
Clark Kent / Superman / Kal-El (voice), played by Justin Hartley.

7
00:23:44,347 --> 00:23:50,347
Bruce Wayne / Batman (voice), played by Anson Mount.

8
00:27:07,826 --> 00:27:13,826
Lois Lane / Rama Kushna (voice), played by Laura Bailey.

9
00:30:31,304 --> 00:30:37,304
Diana Prince / Wonder Woman (voice), played by Janet Varney.

10
00:33:54,782 --> 00:34:00,782
Damian Wayne / Robin / Jimmy Olsen (voice), played by Zach Callison.

11
00:37:18,260 --> 00:37:24,260
Selina Kyle / Catwoman (voice), played by Anika Noni Rose.

12
00:40:41,739 --> 00:40:47,739
Injustice is a 2021 American adult animated superhero film based on the prequel comic series of the 2013
NetherRealm Studios video game Injustice: Gods Among Us, and based on characters from DC Comics.

13
00:44:05,217 --> 00:44:11,217
Produced by Warner Bros.

14
00:47:28,695 --> 00:47:34,695
Animation and DC Entertainment, and distributed by Warner Bros.

15
00:50:52,173 --> 00:50:58,173
Home Entertainment, it is the 47th installment in the DC
Universe Animated Original Movies line.

16
00:54:15,652 --> 00:54:21,652
The film is directed by Matt Peters from a story by Ernie Altbacker and stars
Justin Hartley and Anson Mount as Superman and Batman, respectively.

17
00:57:39,130 --> 00:57:45,130
The film, set in a separate continuity from the main DC Universe, follows Superman’s descent into madness after being tricked
by Joker into killing his pregnant wife Lois Lane and detonating a nuclear weapon that destroys Metropolis.

18
01:01:02,608 --> 01:01:08,608
As Superman transforms the Earth into a police state to enforce global peace, Batman
forms an underground resistance to oppose Superman and his allies.

19
01:04:26,086 --> 01:04:32,086
The film was announced in May 2021, with Altbacker writing the script.

20
01:07:49,565 --> 01:07:55,565
The film adapts elements from both the Injustice video game and its prequel comic book series (primarily
the Year One arc), but tells an original narrative which diverges from the source materials.

21
01:11:13,043 --> 01:11:19,043
The film explores themes of superhero, based on comic, based on video game.

22
01:14:36,521 --> 01:14:42,521
The tone is thought_provoking.
